{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04865","headline":"奉和张岳州王潭州别诗二首 二 · 韦嗣立","name":"奉和张岳州王潭州别诗二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔时陪二贤，缨冕会神仙。\n一去驰江海，相逢共播迁。\n无因千里驾，忽覩四愁篇。\n览讽欢何已，欢终徒怆然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦嗣立","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04865.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04865","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}